Reference datasets of (J)ADE-DLS
================================

Scope: all datasets in this directory ("Test+ReferenceData"), i.e.

  * ALV_gold-nanoparticle-reference-data.zip  (DLS raw data of the gold reference samples)
  * SAXSdata/                                 (SAXS data and fits of the gold reference samples)
  * LSInstruments_gold-nanoparticle-reference-data.zip (LS Spectrometer data incl. CORENN results)
  * the README.md in this directory

